{%- comment -%}
  ns-landing-materials — objection handler + benefit-led "why it works" grid.
  Block 1: the #1 breathing objection, with breathing/safety reassurance.
  Block 2: reframed from a materials-only spec grid to a problem->benefit
  grid (quieter nights / rested mornings / no dry mouth), with a single
  material-based card. Efficacy hedged for compliance.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .ns-lmat__q-section {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px) clamp(14px, 4vw, 32px) clamp(40px, 7vw, 88px);
  }

  .ns-lmat__q-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid rgba(16, 24, 43, .1);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 36px);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(20px, 4vw, 36px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ns-lmat__q-kicker {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: .24em;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #B27E33;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .ns-lmat__q-heading {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 30px);
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .ns-lmat__q-body {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #566072;
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .ns-lmat__checks {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ns-lmat__check {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ns-lmat__check-icon {
    color: #B27E33;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ns-lmat__check-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #566072;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ns-lmat__mat-section {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px) clamp(14px, 4vw, 32px) clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);
  }

  .ns-lmat__mat-kicker {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: .24em;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #B27E33;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .ns-lmat__mat-heading {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4.5vw, 36px);
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .ns-lmat__mat-intro {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #566072;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    max-width: 60ch;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .ns-lmat__mat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(14px, 3vw, 20px);
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .ns-lmat__mat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .ns-lmat__card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 24, 43, .08);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 28px);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ns-lmat__card-icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #EAEDF2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .ns-lmat__card-title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .ns-lmat__card-body {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #566072;
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
</style>

<section class="ns-lmat__q-section">
  <div class="ns-lmat__q-card">
    <div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__q-kicker">{{ section.settings.q_kicker | default: "THE #1 QUESTION" }}</div>
      <h3 class="ns-lmat__q-heading">{{ section.settings.q_heading | default: "&quot;What if I can't breathe?&quot;" }}</h3>
      <p class="ns-lmat__q-body">{{ section.settings.q_body | default: "Fair question. Short answer: you're not sealed shut. NightSeals is a gentle reminder, not a lock. A deliberate yawn or light effort parts your lips easily. Your survival instincts will always win. If your nose is congested, just skip that night." }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ns-lmat__checks">
      <div class="ns-lmat__check"><span class="ns-lmat__check-icon">&#10003;</span><span class="ns-lmat__check-text">{{ section.settings.check_1 | default: "You're never sealed shut &mdash; a light effort parts your lips" }}</span></div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__check"><span class="ns-lmat__check-icon">&#10003;</span><span class="ns-lmat__check-text">{{ section.settings.check_2 | default: "Your survival reflexes always override it" }}</span></div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__check"><span class="ns-lmat__check-icon">&#10003;</span><span class="ns-lmat__check-text">{{ section.settings.check_3 | default: "Nose blocked tonight? Just skip that night" }}</span></div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__check"><span class="ns-lmat__check-icon">&#10003;</span><span class="ns-lmat__check-text">{{ section.settings.check_4 | default: "Ease in with a lighter seal until it feels natural" }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ns-lmat__mat-section">
  <div class="ns-lmat__mat-kicker">{{ section.settings.mat_kicker | default: "WHY IT WORKS" }}</div>
  <h2 class="ns-lmat__mat-heading">{{ section.settings.mat_heading | default: "How one small strip changes the whole night" }}</h2>
  <p class="ns-lmat__mat-intro">{{ section.settings.mat_intro | default: "It's not the tape doing the work &mdash; it's what your body does once your mouth stays closed and you breathe through your nose." }}</p>
  <div class="ns-lmat__mat-grid">
    <div class="ns-lmat__card">
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10182B" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11 5 6 9H3v6h3l5 4V5z"></path><line x1="23" y1="9" x2="17" y2="15"></line><line x1="17" y1="9" x2="23" y2="15"></line></svg></div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-title">{{ section.settings.item_1_title | default: "Quieter nights" }}</div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-body">{{ section.settings.item_1_body | default: "Most snoring is air rushing past a slack, open mouth. Keep it gently closed and that vibration tends to settle &mdash; so you, and whoever sleeps next to you, get quieter nights." }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ns-lmat__card">
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10182B" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 18a5 5 0 0 0-10 0"></path><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="2"></line><line x1="4.22" y1="10.22" x2="5.64" y2="11.64"></line><line x1="1" y1="18" x2="3" y2="18"></line><line x1="21" y1="18" x2="23" y2="18"></line><line x1="18.36" y1="11.64" x2="19.78" y2="10.22"></line><line x1="23" y1="22" x2="1" y2="22"></line><polyline points="8 6 12 2 16 6"></polyline></svg></div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-title">{{ section.settings.item_2_title | default: "Mornings without the fog" }}</div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-body">{{ section.settings.item_2_body | default: "Nose breathing is slower and deeper than mouth breathing, which helps your body settle into steadier rest. Most people notice they wake up less groggy." }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ns-lmat__card">
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10182B" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2.7l5.5 5.5a7.8 7.8 0 1 1-11 0z"></path></svg></div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-title">{{ section.settings.item_3_title | default: "No more 3am dry mouth" }}</div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-body">{{ section.settings.item_3_body | default: "With your mouth closed, the air stops drying you out. Fewer middle-of-the-night water runs, and far less of that sandpaper throat at sunrise." }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ns-lmat__card">
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10182B" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.24 12.24a6 6 0 0 0-8.49-8.49L5 10.5V19h8.5z"></path><line x1="16" y1="8" x2="2" y2="22"></line><line x1="17.5" y1="15" x2="9" y2="15"></line></svg></div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-title">{{ section.settings.item_4_title | default: "Gentle enough to forget" }}</div>
      <div class="ns-lmat__card-body">{{ section.settings.item_4_body | default: "Soft woven fabric and a hypoallergenic, latex-free adhesive. It holds over a beard, peels off clean with no residue, and most people forget it's on by night two." }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

